          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero uku ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " avuze ku vyerekeye abo bavugishwa bariko bavugishwa mw’izina ryiwe: Si jewe nabatumye, ariko bavuga bati: ‘Inkota n’inzara ntibizoshika muri iki gihugu.’ Abo bavugishwa nyene bazorandurwa n’inkota n’inzara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abo bariko baravugishwako bazotererwa mu mayira y’i Yerusalemu kubera ikigoyi n’inkota. Nta muntu wo kubahamba azoboneka baba bo canke abagore babo, abahungu babo canke abakobwa babo. Nzobarekurirako ivyago bibakwiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
